sentences.t:
Por amor de mio Çid esta cort yo fago.
Saludádmelos a todos, entrellos aya espaçio;
desto que les abino aun bien serán ondrados.”

sentences.l:
For love of my Çid this court I make.
Greet-for-me-them to all, among-them let-there-be solace;
of-this that to-them befell yet well they-will-be honoured.”

sentences.t:
Ya les va pesando a ifantes de Carrión,
por que en Toledo el rey fazie cort;
miedo han que i verná mio Çid el Campeador.

sentences.l:
Now to-them it-goes grieving to Infantes of Carrión,
because in Toledo the king was-making court;
fear they-have that there will-come my Çid the Campeador.

sentences.t:
Dixo el rey: “No lo feré, sín salve Dios!
ca i verná mio Çid el Campeador;
darlêdes derecho, ca rencura ha de vos.

sentences.l:
Said the king: “Not it I-will-do, so-me may-save God!
for there will-come my Çid the Campeador;
you-will-give-him right, for grievance he-has of you.

sentences.t:
Quando lo [od]ió el rey, plógol de coraçón;
con grandes yentes el rey cavalgó
e iva reçebir al que en buen ora naçió.

sentences.l:
When it heard the king, it-pleased-him from heart;
with great peoples the king rode
and was-going to-receive to-the-one who in good hour was-born.

sentences.t:
Quando lo ovo a ojo el buen rey don Alfons,
firiós a tierra mio Çid el Campeador;
biltar se quiere e ondrar a so señor.

sentences.l:
When him he-had to eye the good king don Alfons,
struck-himself to ground my Çid the Campeador;
to-abase himself he-wishes and to-honour to his lord.

sentences.t:
Terné vigilia en aqueste santo logar;
cras mañana entraré a la çibdad,
e iré a la cort enantes de yantar.”

sentences.l:
I-will-hold vigil in this holy place;
tomorrow morning I-will-enter to the city,
and I-will-go to the court before of dinner.”

sentences.t:
Mandó fazer candelas e poner en el altar;
sabor a de velar en essa santidad,
al Criador rogando e fablando en poridad.

sentences.l:
He-ordered to-make candles and to-put on the altar;
pleasure he-has of to-keep-watch in that holiness,
to-the Creator praying and speaking in secret.
